#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:14 4e7eedf72b034a6aa6aea37fe9c9838b
msgid "Captures audio output to an internal ring buffer for audio visualization, recording, or analysis."
msgstr "将音频输出捕获到内部环形缓冲区，用于音频可视化、录音或分析。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:19 8f3f9353d1e4423c918949b4271120aa
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:21 d6bba5c6c4d845b6b313de7d5356b001
msgid ""
"Captures the signal passing through an audio bus without changing its output. Attach it with "
":ref:`FmodAudioEffect.apply_to()<class_FmodAudioEffect_method_apply_to>`, then read complete "
"stereo frames with :ref:`get_buffer()<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture_method_get_buffer>`. Each "
":ref:`Vector2<class_Vector2>` contains the left sample in ``x`` and the right sample in ``y``. "
"Mono input is duplicated; input with more than two channels keeps its first two channels."
msgstr ""
"捕获流经音频总线的信号，保持总线输出不变。使用     "
":ref:`FmodAudioEffect.apply_to()<class_FmodAudioEffect_method_apply_to>`     挂载效果器，再通过     "
":ref:`get_buffer()<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture_method_get_buffer>`     读取完整的立体声帧。每个     "
":ref:`Vector2<class_Vector2>`     的     ``x``     存放左声道采样，    ``y``     "
"存放右声道采样。单声道输入会复制到两个声道，多声道输入只保留前两个声道。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:23 73d9ab4219ef439984a31b3d356f5ee5
msgid ""
"When the ring buffer is full, incoming frames are discarded and unread frames are preserved. "
":ref:`clear_buffer()<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture_method_clear_buffer>` clears the queue and "
"resets both counters. Changing "
":ref:`buffer_length<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture_property_buffer_length>` clears queued audio but"
" keeps the counters."
msgstr ""
"环形缓冲区已满时会丢弃新帧，保留尚未读取的旧帧。    "
":ref:`clear_buffer()<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture_method_clear_buffer>`     会清空队列并重置两个计数器。修改     "
":ref:`buffer_length<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture_property_buffer_length>`     会清空队列，但保留计数器。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:25 c5f7df7496404fa2923f1f0a7a525a93
msgid ""
"When added through "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.add_bus_effect()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_add_bus_effect>`, read "
"from the slot's runtime instance returned by "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>`. The"
" configuration resource remains separate from the capture buffer. The example below uses a "
"directly attached standalone effect."
msgstr ""
"通过 :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.add_bus_effect()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_add_bus_effect>` "
"添加时，应从 "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` "
"返回的槽位运行实例读取数据。配置资源与捕获缓冲分别保存。以下示例使用直接挂接的独立效果器。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:29 a5ecd4e8b69446e684a59b94d5dc4dc0
msgid ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var _capture: FmodAudioEffectCapture = FmodAudioEffectCapture.new()\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    _capture.apply_to(FmodServer.get_main_system().get_master_channel_group())\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n"
"    if _capture.can_get_buffer(256):\n"
"        var frames: PackedVector2Array = _capture.get_buffer(256)\n"
"        print(frames[0].x, frames[0].y)"
msgstr ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var _capture: FmodAudioEffectCapture = FmodAudioEffectCapture.new()\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    _capture.apply_to(FmodServer.get_main_system().get_master_channel_group())\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n"
"    if _capture.can_get_buffer(256):\n"
"        var frames: PackedVector2Array = _capture.get_buffer(256)\n"
"        print(frames[0].x, frames[0].y)"

