#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:166 24fc3c03dd3c45628a70e10492f72258
msgid ""
"Removes and returns up to ``frames`` queued stereo frames as a "
":ref:`PackedVector2Array<class_PackedVector2Array>`. Each :ref:`Vector2<class_Vector2>` stores "
"left and right samples in ``x`` and ``y``. If fewer frames are available, the returned array is "
"shorter. Returns an empty array for a nonpositive count or an empty buffer. Reading does not "
"reset either counter."
msgstr ""
"从队列中取出最多     ``frames``     个立体声帧，以     :ref:`PackedVector2Array<class_PackedVector2Array>`     "
"返回。每个     :ref:`Vector2<class_Vector2>`     的     ``x``     和     ``y``     "
"分别存放左右声道采样。可用帧数不足时返回较短的数组；帧数非正或缓冲区为空时返回空数组。读取不会重置计数器。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:176 b15dfbdf781747568c9236c9809fed8c
msgid ":ref:`int<class_int>` **get_discarded_frames**\\ (\\ ) |const|"
msgstr ":ref:`int<class_int>` **get_discarded_frames**\\ (\\ ) |const|"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:178 f676d3ec3f314839bda8c598ddc932a3
msgid ""
"Returns the number of incoming frames dropped because the buffer was full. The unread frames "
"already in the queue are preserved. Reading does not reset this counter; "
":ref:`clear_buffer()<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture_method_clear_buffer>` and detaching the effect "
"reset it."
msgstr ""
"返回因缓冲区已满而丢弃的新帧数。队列中未读取的帧会保留。读取不会重置此计数器；    "
":ref:`clear_buffer()<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture_method_clear_buffer>`     和卸载效果器会将其归零。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:188 c0c0f07f684c49d8a6edd87db2556c04
msgid ":ref:`int<class_int>` **get_frames_available**\\ (\\ ) |const|"
msgstr ":ref:`int<class_int>` **get_frames_available**\\ (\\ ) |const|"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:190 f7c329dd18b743c9acd1adbebeb7407d
msgid ""
"Returns the number of complete stereo frames currently queued. This is the number of "
":ref:`Vector2<class_Vector2>` elements that can be read, rather than the number of individual "
"channel samples."
msgstr "返回队列中完整立体声帧的数量，即可读取的     :ref:`Vector2<class_Vector2>`     元素数。每帧包含两个声道的采样。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:200 30fa40fcbaf44565a894099c4e80a6af
msgid ":ref:`int<class_int>` **get_pushed_frames**\\ (\\ ) |const|"
msgstr ":ref:`int<class_int>` **get_pushed_frames**\\ (\\ ) |const|"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:202 d73451124a8247e787289f09d8541a20
msgid ""
"Returns the number of frames submitted by the audio callback, including frames that were "
"discarded. Reading does not reset this counter; "
":ref:`clear_buffer()<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture_method_clear_buffer>` and detaching the effect "
"reset it."
msgstr ""
"返回音频回调提交的总帧数，包含被丢弃的帧。读取不会重置此计数器；    "
":ref:`clear_buffer()<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture_method_clear_buffer>`     和卸载效果器会将其归零。"
